The following portions of this project are derived from PixiJS DevTools:

Interface (packages/panel):
  - the component layer used to assemble the panel, including property
    editors, collapsible sections, the resizable split, the top bar,
    the theme provider, and UI primitives;
  - the stylesheet and Tailwind theme (src/globals.css,
    tailwind.config.js);
  - the Scene tab, including the tree, its rows and controls, the
    properties pane, and fuzzy search over property names;
  - the texture grid on the Assets tab and the selected-texture panel.

Page-side inspection (packages/core):
  - the duck-typing markers used to identify node types
    (src/adapters/nodeType.ts);
  - GPU texture format size tables (src/adapters/texture.ts);
  - the picker, including tree interaction, hit testing, restoration of
    node state, and the v6 interaction-plugin fallback
    (src/adapters/picking.ts);
  - geometry used to align the highlight with the canvas
    (src/scene/overlay/geometry.ts);
  - per-type property lists, grouping, and ordering
    (src/scene/properties/schema.ts).

